                <p style="margin-top:0;color:var(--muted)">Aerosol packaging safety is a core engineering and regulatory
                    requirement in the global aerosol industry. Every aerosol can must withstand internal pressure
                    generated by propellants at elevated temperatures, remain structurally stable during transport, and
                    pass recognized burst and leakage tests. For startups, students, and new manufacturers,
                    understanding these fundamentals is essential to avoid safety hazards, production losses, and
                    regulatory non-compliance.</p>
